DCC_I18N.add("ar", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "أخبرني عند توفر إصدار جديد", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "لا يُثبَّت شيء إلا إذا اخترت «تثبيت وإعادة التشغيل». عند إيقاف هذا الخيار لا يبحث DCC Lite عن التحديثات من تلقاء نفسه.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "يتوفر إصدار جديد من DCC Lite. افتح «تحديث البرنامج» لتثبيته عندما تكون مستعداً."});
DCC_I18N.add("fr", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "M’avertir quand une nouvelle version est disponible", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "Rien n’est installé sans que vous choisissiez « Installer et redémarrer ». Si cette option est désactivée, DCC Lite ne cherche pas de mises à jour de lui-même.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "Une nouvelle version de DCC Lite est disponible. Ouvrez la mise à jour pour l’installer quand vous êtes prêt."});
DCC_I18N.add("es", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "Avisarme cuando haya una versión nueva", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "No se instala nada si no eliges «Instalar y reiniciar». Con esta opción desactivada, DCC Lite no busca actualizaciones por sí mismo.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "Hay una nueva versión de DCC Lite. Abre la actualización para instalarla cuando quieras."});
DCC_I18N.add("de", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "Benachrichtigen, wenn eine neue Version verfügbar ist", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "Es wird nichts installiert, solange Sie nicht „Installieren und neu starten“ wählen. Ist diese Option aus, sucht DCC Lite nicht selbst nach Updates.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "Eine neue Version von DCC Lite ist verfügbar. Öffnen Sie das Update, um sie zu installieren, wenn Sie bereit sind."});
DCC_I18N.add("ru", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "Сообщать о выходе новой версии", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "Ничего не устанавливается, пока вы не выберете «Установить и перезапустить». Если параметр выключен, DCC Lite сам не ищет обновления.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "Доступна новая версия DCC Lite. Откройте обновление, чтобы установить её, когда будете готовы."});
DCC_I18N.add("tr", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "Yeni sürüm çıktığında bana haber ver", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "“Yükle ve yeniden başlat”ı seçmediğiniz sürece hiçbir şey yüklenmez. Bu seçenek kapalıysa DCC Lite güncellemeleri kendiliğinden aramaz.", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "DCC Lite’ın yeni bir sürümü var. Hazır olduğunuzda yüklemek için güncelleme penceresini açın."});
DCC_I18N.add("zh", {"Tell me when a new version is available": "有新版本时通知我", "Nothing is installed unless you choose Install and restart. When this is off, DCC Lite does not look for updates by itself.": "除非您选择“安装并重启”，否则不会安装任何内容。关闭此选项后，DCC Lite 不会自行检查更新。", "A new DCC Lite version is available. Open Software update to install it when you are ready.": "DCC Lite 有新版本。准备好后，请打开软件更新进行安装。"});
